<title>USA: Lennar Corp Q4 Nov 30 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Lennar Corp Q4 Nov 30 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 11/30    12 Mos ended 11/30</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	1996	1995</p>
<p>    Total revenues	 376,306  274,023  1,181,161  870,468</p>
<p>    Total oper earnings   59,792   42,615    187,668  145,233</p>
<p> Net earnings		 28,606   20,029     87,986   70,427</p>
